<!-- Installed to /vendor/etc/displayconfig/. Panel id matches
     persist.vendor.fingerprint.sensor_location in vendor.prop.
     Light-sensor horizons are copied from stock MIUI (product/etc/displayconfig).
     The brightness map is the sweet overlay's existing
     config_screenBrightnessBacklight / config_screenBrightnessNits, converted
     with AOSP's (backlight - 1) / 254. The first point has to be at or below
     the minimum backlight (config_screenBrightnessSettingMinimum = 2, i.e.
     1/254), or DisplayDeviceConfig throws and system_server crashes. -->
